{"id":"nchi-2b1824","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"The composer for an existing (idle) agent shows the full path (\"/Users/me/code/acme/nocchi\"). The new-chat folder button already shortens it to \"acme/nocchi\" (commit `c0957e8`).\n\nUse the same label in `ContextChip`, with the full path in the tooltip. Move the label logic out of `FolderPicker` into one shared helper, so both chips use it.\n\nRequested by the user, 2026-10-02.","dependencies":null,"labels":null},"created_at":"2026-10-02T08:02:41.674675Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
