{"id":"nchi-48617b","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"The new-chat flow through Herdr (`layout.apply` with `command: [\"claude\", message]`, since nchi-d952cb) has only run against a fake agent script in tests, and once by hand.\n\nAdd an opt-in integration test (`NOCCHI_LIVE_CLAUDE=1`) in an isolated `nocchi-it-*` Herdr session. It starts real Claude (haiku) with a one-line message in an untrusted folder, answers the trust question, and checks the message gets answered. See the spec.\n\nIt uses the user's Claude account (a tiny request), so it's opt-in and never part of a plain `swift test`.","dependencies":null,"labels":null},"created_at":"2026-10-02T08:55:33.956814Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
