{"id":"nchi-48617b","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7af62944-8307-4618-a432-0f406b310041","text":"One-time check run on 2026-10-02 with a real agent (Claude Code v2.1.287, Haiku 4.5), through the real `HerdrAdapter.perform(.start(…, prompt:))` in an isolated Herdr session. **Passed in 8 s:**\n- `perform` returned `herdr/w1:p2`.\n- The adapter reported it `blocked` on Claude's trust question (\"❯ No, exit\" selected by default), with the message not yet answered.\n- `pane.send_keys [\"Down\"]` moved the cursor to \"Yes, I trust this folder\"; `[\"Enter\"]` confirmed.\n- Claude then answered the launch message: `⏺ nocchi-ok`. Status went working → idle.\n\nSo an argv prompt does survive the trust question. That confirms the fix for nchi-0b5987 end to end.\n\n**Cleanup:**\n- The isolated session and its /tmp folder were removed by the harness.\n- The transcript folder `~/.claude/projects/-private-tmp-nocchi-it-fbf3b422-live-check` (only this session) was deleted.\n- The project entry was removed from `~/.claude.json`, after a backup, with an atomic replace. The project list is identical to before; only Claude's own launch counters changed.\n- The temporary test file was deleted. No code changes."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T09:01:20.925821Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
