{"id":"nchi-0289b6","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Create LinkedIn promo video for Nocchi","description":"Produce a playful, music-driven Nocchi product promo for agent users and developers on LinkedIn.\n\nThe video opens with “Your agents are busy. Can you keep up?”, demonstrates Nocchi’s native notch animations and multi-agent states, and closes with the GitHub icon and `nicbet/nocchi` for awareness.\n\nThe final creative brief, storyboard/review mode, capture approach, and acceptance criteria will be captured in the issue spec before implementation.","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a0","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-10-12T16:59:56.63673Z","created_by":"codex-mcp-client/0.162.1 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
