{"id":"nchi-651214","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-48d6fc57-b38a-498a-9d08-e46d6c32c053","text":"Implemented: five library products, a NocchiMascot target and test target, and the public face API. Also added `ProcessTable.Entry.init`, the only gap the consumer found outside the mascot. `swift test`: 140 tests pass. The snapshot renders. A scratchpad consumer builds and runs against all five products. It covers AgentStore with MockAdapter, both adapters, ProcessTable, TerminalApps.host, WindowRaiser, and FaceView/FaceRenderer/FaceNSView. Spec deviations are recorded in the spec's Decisions section."},"created_at":"2026-10-16T08:19:13.031895Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.301 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
