{"id":"nchi-09c34c","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a63512c7-a9eb-40cf-8914-bbb212cf1c2f","text":"Fixed per spec; `swift test` passes (150 tests). `shell` now counts as `idle`: after `busy` → done (celebrated), after `waiting` → idle, and `shell ↔ idle` changes nothing. The existing `aTurnFromStartToFinish` test used the old idea of `shell` (mid-turn), so it's now `idle, busy, idle`. The new `aBackgroundCommandDoesntKeepItWorking` test covers the recorded sequence. PLAN M6 updated."},"created_at":"2026-10-16T12:58:37.488496Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.301 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
