{"id":"nchi-7f44f6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3bf65e6f-bbf0-48d1-9193-5d385dd9fc85","text":"README updated (docs only): Requirements list the Herdr app (hc 0.1.19+ with herdr-app) and the TUI as an optional, off-by-default source. Also updated: the folder-drop behaviour in the app, the Sources row (with the no-duplicates note), `herdrSession`/`herdrSocketPath` marked TUI-only, dev dependencies and the `make test`/`make live SOURCE=` notes, and `NocchiHerdrCore` in the library list. Also noted that Herdr app agents leave `AgentInfo.host` empty."},"created_at":"2026-11-09T15:53:25.018977Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.319 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
