{"id":"nchi-acbee0","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-35bcee06-1333-4a34-9528-d54cf1f88117","text":"Canceled 2026-11-13 at the developer's request as probably obsolete: no activity since 2026-10-15, and no branch or worktree for it remains. Herdr agents now come from herdr-core (nchi-169460), and bots will replace starting agents in Herdr (nchi-a4f8e6). If the invisible SDK-spawned sessions show up again, reopen it or file a new bug."},"created_at":"2026-11-13T10:59:35.153519Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.323 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
